HELP - Searchable command reference

help                         First page of registered commands and aliases.
help commands [page]         Browse the complete command index.
help all [page]              Same index.
help social [page]           Browse all registered social actions.
help search <text> [page]    Find command names containing text.
help <command>               Read command help, including short aliases.
help <spell-name>            Read an original spell page.
help spells                  Original full spell catalog.
help spell                   Your learned-spell listing command.
help policy                  Server policy.
help dm                      Your staff and DM command guide.

Use dmcommands for role-based powers and dmcommands native [page] for
native class powers. Use skills for class/level-eligible skills and skills
all for the full skill catalog. Listing help never grants a permission,
learns a spell or bypasses a cooldown. Duplicate registrations are omitted;
registered aliases remain visible. Ordinary command requirements still apply.
